WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:06.590
It's been almost a decade since Marvel's Iron
Man made superhero movie skeptics sit up and

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:11.639
take notice, and the comic book movie craze
isn't going away anytime soon.

00:00:11.639 --> 00:00:16.911
There are a slew of superhero flicks scheduled
to hit cinemas over the next few years, but

00:00:16.911 --> 00:00:22.360
as franchises continue to expand, it becomes
harder and harder to keep track of what's

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.110
happening and who's who.

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:28.650
"Wait a minute you guys aren't the real Avengers,
Hulk gives it away."

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:33.140
This is everything you need to know about
upcoming superhero movies through the end

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:34.600
of 2018.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:36.579
Thor: Ragnarok

00:00:36.579 --> 00:00:41.910
Chris Hemsworth will reprise his role as the
hilariously heroic Asgardian god in Marvel's

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:47.239
Thor: Raganarok, and Tom Hiddleston will be
back to make sure no new villains take over

00:00:47.239 --> 00:00:53.050
his spot as number one fanboy villain, though
he'll face stiff competition from Cate Blanchett.

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:57.820
The British Oscar winner comes on board as
Hela, goddess of the underworld, who might

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:00.559
just be the best Marvel villain yet.

00:01:00.559 --> 00:01:04.930
The film takes a cue from the surreal visuals
of Doctor Strange, and looks like it's been

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:08.940
pulled right out of the comic pages, which
is a good thing.

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:15.259
And with director Taika Waititi at the helm,
Ragnarok's November 3rd, 2017 release date

00:01:15.259 --> 00:01:17.180
can't come soon enough.

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:18.710
Thor agrees.

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:22.990
"I'm not up to much at the moment.

00:01:22.990 --> 00:01:26.360
What are you doing later?"

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:27.520
Justice League

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:32.259
If the future of DC films relies on any one
project, it's Justice League.

00:01:32.259 --> 00:01:38.280
The eagerly awaited team-up of DC's greatest
heroes could make or break the Extended Universe

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:39.909
after its rocky start.

00:01:39.909 --> 00:01:45.070
Equaling the success of Marvel's Avengers
is the basic goal for DC here, and director

00:01:45.070 --> 00:01:48.329
Joss Whedon is on board to help make that
happen.

00:01:48.329 --> 00:01:53.070
Whedon has agreed to shepherd Justice League
through post-production and will also shoot

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:58.740
some additional scenes, still aiming for the
original November 17th, 2017 release date.

00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:04.970
Ben Affleck, Henry Cavill and Gal Gadot will
be joined by Jason Momoa as Aquaman, Ezra

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:08.090
Miller as The Flash and Ray Fisher as Cyborg.

00:02:08.090 --> 00:02:13.760
Irish actor Ciaran Hinds confirmed that he's
playing classic villain Steppenwolf via motion

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:14.760
capture.

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:20.700
With one of Darkseid's main men finally onscreen,
can Darkseid be far behind?

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:24.280
And will DC films finally lighten up a little?

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:26.340
"Dressed like a bat.

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:27.340
I dig it."

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:29.560
We hope so.

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:31.400
Black Panther

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:35.900
While we're not sure how the big screen version
of Wakanda will differ from Stan Lee and Jack

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:42.590
Kirby's comic book vision of a high-tech jungle
world, we'll find out on February 16th, 2018.

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:47.920
After a handful of screenplay edits and juggling
directors, Marvel secured Creed director Ryan

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:52.570
Coogler, and the sizzle reel for Black Panther
which recently screened at Marvel's Los Angeles

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:55.560
offices reportedly had everyone very excited.

00:02:55.560 --> 00:03:00.879
Joining Chadwick Boseman as Black Panther
will be Lupita Nyong'o, Forest Whitaker, Angela

00:03:00.879 --> 00:03:05.870
Bassett, and Creed's Michael B. Jordan, who
said that Black Panther will be a "very honest

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:07.430
and gritty" movie.

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:12.819
How that will fall in with comedic action
fare like Guardians of the Galaxy and Ant-Man

00:03:12.819 --> 00:03:19.700
is anyone's guess, but with Andy Serkis' evil
Ulysses Klaw showing up, anything is possible.

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:21.560
New Mutants

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:26.989
Fox has handed the reins of their X-Men spinoff
franchise to filmmaker Josh Boone, who admitted

00:03:26.989 --> 00:03:29.920
to being "obsessed with Marvel Comics."

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:34.640
He took it upon himself to convince the studio
to put the New Mutants on the big screen,

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:39.819
and alongside co-writer Knate Gwaltney, they
put together their own New Mutants comic book

00:03:39.819 --> 00:03:42.849
based on stories they wanted to adapt for
Fox.

00:03:42.849 --> 00:03:44.659
The studio loved it.

00:03:44.659 --> 00:03:50.160
Fox recently confirmed a release date of April
2018, with Game of Thrones vet Maisie Williams

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:55.019
signed on to play the hairy mutant Wolfsbane,
and The Witch star Anya Taylor-Joy signed

00:03:55.019 --> 00:03:58.390
on to star as Magik, sister of the X-Men's
Colossus.

00:03:58.390 --> 00:04:03.709
Stranger Things star Charlie Heaton will portray
the jet-powered mutant Cannonball, 13 Reasons

00:04:03.709 --> 00:04:09.530
Why actor Henry Zaga is signed on as Sunspot,
and newcomer Blu Hunt will take on the part

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:11.540
of Native American mutant Moonstar.

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:16.060
Rumor has it that they'll be up against one
of Marvel's weirdest villains, and one of

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:19.139
their early adversaries: the Demon Bear.

00:04:19.139 --> 00:04:22.100
And everyone knows that bears are bad news.

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:24.970
"I'm sick of these constant bear attacks.

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:28.610
It's like a freakin country bear jamboroo
around here!"

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:30.390
Avengers: Infinity War

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:35.240
Good news, impatient Marvel fans: Infinity
War will be a standalone movie, and not broken

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:40.110
up into two films released an excruciating
year apart as originally thought.

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:44.169
Directors Joe and Anthony Russo cleared up
the confusion, admitting that the working

00:04:44.169 --> 00:04:45.419
titles were "misleading."

00:04:45.419 --> 00:04:48.660
And we'll see it all on May 4th, 2018.

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:53.830
MCU fans know to expect to see just about
every Marvel superhero appearing in a battle

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:59.070
against Thanos, and behind the scenes footage
from Marvel as confirmed Star-Lord actor Chris

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:02.400
Pratt on set with Robert Downey Jr. and Tom
Holland.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:06.699
Brie Larson's Captain Marvel is also set to
make her MCU debut.

00:05:06.699 --> 00:05:11.259
Marvel is positioning the two upcoming Avengers
flicks as the culmination of everything they've

00:05:11.259 --> 00:05:15.819
been working toward since the first Iron Man
movie dropped in 2008.

00:05:15.819 --> 00:05:18.470
Marvel's Joe Russo confirms the hype.

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:23.860
"These next two Avengers films will be an
event like no one has seen on film before."

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:29.900
Marvel Studios head honcho Kevin Feige also
addresses their well-documented villain issue.

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:35.490
"Thanos shows us why he is the biggest, the
best, the baddest villain that we've ever

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:36.490
had."

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:38.680
What should we expect in Infinity War's sequel?

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:44.039
The Russos have revealed that they're considering
as many as 67 well-known Marvel characters

00:05:44.039 --> 00:05:46.479
to round out the film's incredible roster.

00:05:46.479 --> 00:05:51.199
The title of the sequel was being kept under
wraps at Marvel, though Guardians of the Galaxy

00:05:51.199 --> 00:05:55.640
star Zoe Saldana recently dropped a huge hint
by mistake.

00:05:55.640 --> 00:06:00.039
"And we all have to go back for Gauntlet later
this year."

00:06:00.039 --> 00:06:03.919
Does that mean Avengers 4 will be called Infinity
Gauntlet?

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:08.480
All we know is that one of those 67 Marvel
characters had better be MODOK.

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:11.200
"Surrender to MODOK!"

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:16.640
"Seriously dude, you've got baby arms and
legs!"

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:17.620
Deadpool 2

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:23.560
After 2016's Deadpool became the highest-grossing
film in the X-Men franchise, keeping the creative

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:26.639
team together for the follow-up seemed essential.

00:06:26.639 --> 00:06:32.419
But director Tim Miller has departed the sequel,
allegedly because star Ryan Reynolds didn't

00:06:32.419 --> 00:06:34.740
back his demands for a larger budget.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:39.699
David Leitch of John Wick fame has since stepped
up to direct, and Josh Brolin will be welcomed

00:06:39.699 --> 00:06:43.470
into the fold as the Merc With a Mouth's time-traveling
foil, Cable.

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:50.020
Jack Kesy, best known as philandering rocker
Gabriel Bolivar in FX vampire series The Strain,

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:54.250
has reportedly signed on as the villainous
mutant Black Tom Cassidy.

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:58.650
And because it wouldn't be Deadpool without
his reluctant, accidental sidekicks, Stefan

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:04.599
Kapicic and Brianna Hildebrand will return
as metallic X-Man Colossus and his understudy

00:07:04.599 --> 00:07:06.270
Negasonic Teenage Warhead.

00:07:06.270 --> 00:07:11.370
Prepare to be offended in the best possible
way on June 1st, 2018.

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:12.970
The Incredibles 2

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:17.710
After veering off into live action, Pixar
legend Brad Bird is set to return to his bread

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:22.750
and butter with a follow up to his 2004 animated
superhero smash, The Incredibles.

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:28.819
A second outing with the Parr family was first
announced in 2014, a decade after the original

00:07:28.819 --> 00:07:31.319
film, with a 2019 release date penciled in.

00:07:31.319 --> 00:07:33.180
When pressed for details, Bird said,

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:35.900
"I don't like unwrapping presents before Christmas.

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:40.110
[The film is] very actively moving, and we're
excited about it.

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:42.620
[We're] trying to take it in some new directions."

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:47.569
Just a few months later, Frozone voice actor
Samuel Jackson was posting photos to Instagram

00:07:47.569 --> 00:07:52.120
from his Incredibles 2 recording session,
and the film's much-anticipated release date

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:58.020
had been moved forward to June 2018, with
Toy Story 4 pushed back to make way.

00:07:58.020 --> 00:07:59.419
Ant-Man and the Wasp

00:07:59.419 --> 00:08:05.229
Kevin Feige recently confirmed that the sequel
to 2015's Ant-Man would go into production

00:08:05.229 --> 00:08:11.400
in summer 2017, with the aim being to wrap
in time for a release by July, 2018.

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:16.370
Michael Douglas confirmed that he'd be returning
as Hank Pym, and he won't be the only returning

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:21.240
member of the supporting cast, with Michael
Pena and David Dastmalchian also set to reprise

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:26.120
their roles, alongside Paul Rudd and Evangeline
Lilly in the titular roles.

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:31.159
Returning director Peyton Reed seems excited
about the film, particularly about introducing

00:08:31.159 --> 00:08:33.000
The Wasp to the MCU, saying,

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:38.160
"For me as a comic nerd, I always thought
of Ant-Man and Wasp as a team and that's a

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:40.670
lot of what the second movie is really about.

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:44.440
To show her finally fully formed in this movie
is really exciting."

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:45.440
Venom

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:51.090
Sony has been trying to produce a Venom movie
for over a decade, but we now finally have

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:56.800
confirmation that the studio is prioritizing
the project, pushing for an October 2018 release.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:09:01.480
Powerhouse Tom Hardy has signed on to play
the lead role of Eddie Brock, the first villain

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:04.790
to take on the Venom symbiote suit in Marvel
comics.

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:09.760
Sony confirmed the casting when they tweeted
a photo of Hardy wearing a Venom t-shirt along

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:13.790
with a caption that revealed production is
set to start this fall.

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:17.580
Directing duties have been offered to Zombieland's
Ruben Fleischer.

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:22.190
Producers are hoping Hardy is better received
by fans than Sony's previous Venom, played

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:26.600
by Topher Grace, as Hardy's set to play a
central role in what they're calling the Sony

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:28.190
Marvel Universe.

00:09:28.190 --> 00:09:32.330
Hardy will be working from a script penned
by Scott Rosenberg and The Amazing Spider-Man

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:34.570
2 co-writer Jeff Pinkner.

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:36.630
X-Men: Dark Phoenix

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:42.270
Fox has announced the 12th film in their X-Franchise,
based on the life and death of Jean Grey,

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:47.001
loosely centered on the events around the
Uncanny X-Men story arc of the same name,

00:09:47.001 --> 00:09:50.600
and the cosmic force responsible for Grey
going a little crazy.

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:54.550
X-Men: Dark Phoenix is set to open in November
2018.

00:09:54.550 --> 00:09:59.390
Few other details are known at this stage,
though an Instagram post from James McAvoy

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:01.400
suggests that he'll be involved.

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:06.100
The Scot snapped himself having dinner with
fellow Professor X actor Patrick Stewart and

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:11.910
long time franchise producer Simon Kinberg,
captioning the pic "I can't wait for the summer,"

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:15.330
which is when production is scheduled to take
place.

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:16.330
Aquaman

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:21.220
DC fans got their first glimpse of natural
born badass Jason Momoa as Aquaman in Batman

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:25.890
versus Superman: Dawn of Justice last year,
and they'll be seeing him again in next year's

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:29.690
Justice League before his first solo flick
hits screens.

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:35.830
While the casting seems solid, question marks
remain over Aquaman after a series of destabilizing

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:40.921
changes behind the scenes, and whether it
will meet its December 21st, 2018 release

00:10:40.921 --> 00:10:41.921
date.

00:10:41.921 --> 00:10:46.690
DC Comics is already adjusting Aquaman's paper
counterpart to look and act more like Momoa's

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:51.380
bigscreen King of the Sea, so we'll be getting
a pretty good idea of what to expect when

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:54.600
he finally makes his real debut in Justice
League.

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:59.080
One thing's for certain, however: no one's
going to make fun of Aquaman after this.

00:10:59.080 --> 00:10:59.700
No one.

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:07.900
Thanks for watching!

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:10.740
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:11:10.740 --> 00:11:13.200
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

